# Reports: Markdown stays ignored by default (*.md above); track evaluation reports explicitly.
!reports/retrieval_reranking_evaluation_complete.md
!reports/reranker_ablation_completion.md
!reports/audit/*.md
!reports/experiments/**/*.md
# Large regenerable run artifacts: hashes, schema and regeneration command live in
# <run>/large_artifacts.json; compact summaries are tracked instead.
reports/experiments/*/retrieval_per_query.jsonl
reports/experiments/*/work/
reports/experiments/esci-reranker-ablation-v1/hard_negative_mining.jsonl
